   "Individual DXB-NE (NC / NAS / Mednet): base at OP diagnostic 0%, consultation '20% up to AED 50 (standard)', pharmacy 0%, network Option 1; co-pay, deductible, pharmacy, network option, nationality and TPA factors from Factors-Individual. No AML factor for Individual (fixed by the ToB, SPEC §8.4).",
